      "updated": 1783271024758,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Checks target metrics (e.g. percentages, counts)\n\u2022 Computes absolute drift and percentage variance\n\u2022 Verifies if difference exceeds acceptable 10% threshold\n\u2022 E.g. 5.9% vs. 4.3% (+1.6% absolute drift, 37.2% variance)",
