      "text": "\u2022 Analyzes semantic, policy, and logic drifts\n\u2022 Prompts LLM with new vs. historical statement context\n\u2022 Classifies strictly into three specific categorical labels:\n  1. Consistent with prior statements\n  2. Contradicts statement from [date]\n  3. No prior record",
